WEBVTT

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.160
Thanks, President!
I appreciate you coming shopping with me!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.200
No problem. If you ever need a hand,
just let me know!

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.540
It's good exercise.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.160
By the way, this is a bit
off the subject, but...

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.000
Hmm? What?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.410
Have you found the love of your life?

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.950
Wha--?! Love of my life?!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.160
You never gave it any thought?

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.540
Th-That's not true.
I just wasn't expecting you to bring it up.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:47.410
Really? Well, I'm pretty sure I found mine!

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:51.330
C'mon, tell me yours! You don't have to hide it!

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.330
M-Maybe you're right.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:59.540
Hmm... But they're both so special,
it's hard to choose.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.000
W-Wait!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.080
For me, it's...!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.540
Mine's probably mighty tree!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.410
Eh?

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:10.870
Don't you know? It's a plant-type maju.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.620
Th-The love of your life is a maju?

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.080
Yup! What else would it be?

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:19.330
Y-You got me there!

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.580
<i>Let's dive right into today's letters</i>

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:38.080
<i>It's "Personal Advice" and the title is</i>

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.080
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.660
<i>Hey, hear me out.</i>
<i>There's something I really wanna say</i>

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:59.910
<i>You've got courage to follow</i>
<i>your dreams which is why I chose you</i>

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.040
<i>Is it a risky bet</i>

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:07.500
<i>Despite no experience,</i>
<i>we jumped right in together</i>

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.950
<i>And this unpredictable story</i>

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:17.040
<i>Is your creation--</i>
<i>a heart-throbbing innovation</i>

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.500
<i>Quickly! Quickly! Take me along</i>

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.120
<i>On a bittersweet love venture</i>

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:26.910
<i>Ah! Measured not by skill</i>
<i>but by scale and romance</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.950
<i>Hurry! Hurry! Boldly, subtly, show your appeal</i>

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:37.040
<i>Ah! Our meeting was a miracle</i>
<i>that can't be neglected</i>

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:40.620
<i>It's galactic level</i>

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.120
<i>I see. Sounds like you're head over heels.</i>

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.410
<i>Let's tell him, just like battle</i>

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.790
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:54.160
<i>Everyone, Hurry! Hurry Love! Love!!</i>

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.500
"Episode Eight: New Species Discovered"

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:03.080
And guess what? There was a huge
group of 'em deep in the dungeon!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.330
Yeah? Sounds like trouble!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.370
What happened after that?

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:12.080
When they tried to sneak past,
something crazy happened!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.450
What?! What?!

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:14.950
We're back!

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.750
Oh, welcome back!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.910
What then?! What crazy thing happened?!

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:23.040
The adventurer said one spoke to him!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.080
No way! They can do that?!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:29.040
That's right!
Everyone's saying it's a new species!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.040
I'd sure like to see it!

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.370
What a cool story!

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:34.410
What story?

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.750
I guess there's some new maju that can speak!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.250
Huh? For real?!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.200
Yup! That's what Marika heard.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:46.160
But you know, we've actually
met a talking maju before.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.910
--Overtime... Overtime...
--Work on weekends...

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:55.700
Oh, yeah. That boss maju
made you guys slave away.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.040
"Didn't Happen"
Nuh-uh! Didn't happen!

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:04.700
Ahem! It does more than grumble, though.
This maju can actually talk.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.410
Do you know of famnela?

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:10.790
The humanoid maju, right?
I hear they're quite intelligent.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:15.620
That's right. It's like one of those
that can talk super fluently.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.830
Yeah? That's incredible!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.000
It must be a new species!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.200
President...

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.540
Hmm? What's up?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.830
...see it.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:25.870
Huh?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.620
I wanna see it!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.500
I wanna meet it!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.700
That famnela!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.910
H-Hyper, are we?

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:37.830
It can fricken talk! It can talk with people!

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.410
I-I guess.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.910
My mind is blown!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.790
His crazy switch flipped.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.450
I wanna meet it! I wanna meet it!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.040
M-Makoto?

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.200
I'm going on ahead!

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.910
You guys can catch up with me!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.080
He really left.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:10.660
There's something wrong with him.
And to think he's my brother...

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:19.080
A-All right! We can't let him go alone,
so let's get moving too!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:24.410
You're such a softy sometimes.
We don't have to babysit him, you know.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.080
It's not that. I'm curious too.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:35.250
First came that weird dungeon,
and now a talking maju...

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:39.450
It all might tie into the Big Gate
my dad's investigating.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.290
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.370
You guys are so slow!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.910
Says the dummy who forgot his new equipment!

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.540
That's right! It was such a pain
to bring your stuff!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.160
The president carried it all though.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.500
Yutoria has a weapon too?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.160
Anyways, I'm impressed!

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.790
The equipment looks great on you guys!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.370
So kind of you for the compliment!

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.580
You're merely stating the obvious!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.290
Flattery will get you nowhere!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.410
Th-That wasn't my intention.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.910
Who cares about them? Hurry up!

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.660
C'mon, President! Let's go!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.870
Whoa! Hold on! Wait!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.950
Maju matter more than us?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.910
Sorry. I don't get it.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.700
I'm not seeing it.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:42.580
Where could it be? Over there?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:48.410
Makoto! Calm your ass down!
You'll scare the famnela away!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.790
I just can't help it!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:54.290
I've heard that famnela move in packs.
If we can find--

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:57.080
Oh, yeah, you're right! In that case...

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.750
If I do this and listen for footsteps...

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.120
Wow! You can do that?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.540
I've never tried.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.910
My love for maju will steer us the right way!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.580
Follow me!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.910
Argh, sheesh! Give it a rest!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.330
Where are they? This way?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.410
Makoto, wait up!
You'll trip if you rush like that!

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.950
Oy! See what I told you?!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:32.000
Ow, ow, ow... Huh?

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.660
Guys, check this out!

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.830
Is that kirakuri?!

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.620
It's rare to find some in
the middle of a dungeon!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.120
Hey, look! That's not all there is!

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.910
It's beautiful!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:50.040
Look at all the types!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.540
Famnela love shiny stuff like this.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:56.370
I bet they're somewhere close!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.950
Makoto, there!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.580
Famnela!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.370
There's a lot of 'em too.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.750
Guys, let's watch from afar and make sure--

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.700
Hey, hey! Can you talk?!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.040
I'm Makoto! Do you understand?!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:17.910
Hey, hey! Let's be friends!
It's all right! Chill out!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.160
Okay?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.290
--Makoto!
--Makoto!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.660
You idiot! What are you doing?!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.120
It was working!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.830
See?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.450
What part of it?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.620
Seems like they're hostile now.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:42.620
Let's act before someone gets hurt!
President, your orders?!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.120
Right.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:49.040
They weren't aggressive at first,
and the new species might flee if we fight.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.290
Let's just drive 'em away.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:55.290
My time to shine, huh? Leave it to me!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.620
Aww, there they go.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:08.450
I've never seen famnela before.
They sure look like people.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:13.330
It's true. And they run away
from danger just like we do too.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.700
Famnela are one of the smarter maju.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:21.330
Not only do they move as a group,
they can attack together as well.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.290
Let's not make enemies of 'em then.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:30.040
True... From now on,
try to think before you act, Makoto.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.870
You're right. I don't know what came over me.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.580
Sorry. I'll be more careful and--

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.200
Whoa! It's niorone!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.500
M-Makoto?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.870
Look how much I got!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.120
Niorone's a special herb
that works just like healing magic!

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.500
He's already gone bonkers again.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.450
Y-Yeah? Good for you.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.040
Makoto! Get a hold of yourself!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:02.250
A-All right. I'm an adventurer too, you know.
I can be calm if I--

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:07.250
Whoa, look! It's a crystal flower--
a super valuable plant!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.330
Is it?

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:11.200
It's said they give you incredible luck!

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.830
I want it so bad...

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.950
...it makes me tremble!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.290
W-Wait, Makoto!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:23.080
The ground there doesn't look stable!
Be careful or--

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.080
Huh?!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.250
Ugh! Not again!

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:37.000
Ow, ow, ow...

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.450
Huh? Makoto! You okay?!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.200
Shoot! He's knocked out!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.830
Can we get back?

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:53.160
Hey! Yutoria! Akari! Marika!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:57.950
What now? I can't carry Makoto all on my own.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.790
Huh? What's that?

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.080
I-It moved!

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:20.830
Th-This is... definitely cause for concern.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.750
Makoto! President!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.830
It's useless. This hole goes on forever.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.660
President... Makoto...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.660
We'll just have to find a path
that leads down there.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.660
Good grief! You leave me no choice!

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:58.450
Huh?

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:02.370
At this rate, Mr. Makoto will be in danger!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:09.950
Huh?!

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.250
It's like that time with the restructroot...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:24.500
It's all crunch and no taste!
This ain't yummy at all!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.160
It's eating everything...

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.500
Whew! Thanks for the meal!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.500
I'll pretend I didn't see that.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.910
Stare...

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.910
Hmm?

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.660
It's staring at me!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:59.120
Mr. President.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.160
You hear me, Mr. President?

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:03.410
Y-Yes! What is it?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.200
No need to be so scared.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:10.370
Believe it or not, I actually like you a lot.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.500
U-Um... What are you exactly?

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.750
I am...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.660
...just a normal rucksack!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.250
I-I find that hard to believe.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:30.910
In any case, Kibou Company
is incredibly important to Mr. Makoto.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.830
When he's excited, he loses sight
of what's around him, but...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:39.790
He's a pure, honest, and kind young man.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:43.290
Yeah. You're absolutely right.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:47.660
That's why I'm counting on you
to take good care of him, got it?

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.450
Right.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:57.370
Makoto! You're awake?!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:01.540
Huh? I remember slipping into a pit and...

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.250
Yeah. You lost consciousness.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:10.040
I see... But are you all right?
Did maju attack you or anything?

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.040
Um, well, you see...

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.700
Nope! Nothing happened!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.370
Thank goodness. But...

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.080
Hmm?

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.000
I'm sorry.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.330
My actions put you in danger.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.500
I-It's all right. I'm fine.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.700
But maybe you should try toning it down a bit.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.290
Yeah. My bad.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:44.500
I'll act more like an adventurer
and employee of Kibou Company...

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.910
...by acting calm and collected.

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:49.040
Makoto...

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:56.500
He really is pure, honest, and kind.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.950
But what should we do now?

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:07.040
I'd like to find the others,
but there's no easy way back up.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:10.040
We'll have to look for another... Hmm?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.660
Huh? Yutoria?

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:17.040
President! Makoto!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:21.290
If you're not there, say something!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:26.540
No point in looking for famnela
when our president might've bit the dust.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.200
It's bad luck to say things like that!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.330
Besides, he's as tenacious as a cockroach!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.330
Wait!

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.450
Something's moving.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.910
President Cockroach?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.040
Please don't say it like that!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:01.750
U-Um, we're from Kibou Company.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.330
U-Um, huh?

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:10.200
I'm sorry. I think I ran out
of business cards, actually.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.000
Do you mind if I get your name?

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.870
I'm Mineko.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:20.250
What a relief. I didn't think
we'd run into other adventurers.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:24.750
I'm the president, Minato.
This is my employee, Makoto.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.620
Our company isn't the largest around, but...

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.200
...we pride ourselves on working together and--

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:33.540
President! There's no need to be so formal.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.910
R-Really? Sorry about that.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:44.200
To be honest, we got split up
from our group and are totally lost.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:48.290
If you know this place,
could you show us the way back up?

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:53.040
N-No? I swear, we're not suspicious!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.330
This way.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.830
Nice going, Makoto!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.830
Yeah...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.660
There. Watch your head.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:13.160
There. Watch your step.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.950
You sure know a lot about this place.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.910
Have you cleared this dungeon before?

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:25.410
Oh, that's confidential! Sorry for even asking.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:43.000
This goes up. Go this way.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.540
Thanks so much! You're a lifesaver!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:51.410
I'd like to thank you somehow,
so could you tell us your company's add--

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.830
Don't want thanks.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.410
We want to show our appreciation.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:59.700
So, do you think we could see your face?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:13.040
It's okay. There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:19.330
Huh? A famnela?

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:23.910
But, she looks a bit different
than a normal one...

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.450
And she's been talking to us too!

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:31.410
Oh! Could it be? She's the one that can talk?

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.540
I figured that was the case.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:36.040
Makoto? You've known?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.000
I guessed it from the moment we saw her.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.410
I wanted to confirm it right away,
but I swore to be calm and collected.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.540
Told you the way. I leave now.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.790
Wait! You're hurt, right?

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:57.080
I can look at your wound if you're okay with it.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.910
Don't worry, I'm a priest!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.410
Healing's right up my alley!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.200
But...

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.410
You take this... and go like this...

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.200
I'm putting the niorone on.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.370
It'll make the pain go away.

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:17.620
Now, we just wrap it with a bandage and...

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.620
There!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:23.410
Okay! You're good to go!

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:27.120
Huh? What's wrong? Does it still hurt?

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.500
Mind your own business.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.830
Huh?

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:34.910
Mineko was fine with how it was before.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:36.200
You're kidding!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:42.540
Sorry! I guess I went a little too far.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:46.620
The thing is, I've been looking
for you this whole time.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.450
I came to this dungeon just to meet you.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.250
So...

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:57.500
If you'd like, would you become friends with me?

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.250
Fri... ends?

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:06.750
Yeah. I want to know more about Mineko.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:11.290
Friends? A human... and Mineko?

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.200
Yup. Friends.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:20.450
You damn maju! Get away from Makoto!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.080
Mineko!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.330
Whew! That was a close call, Makoto!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:41.700
Remember to tell your sister
how I saved your life!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.160
What have you done?

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:46.040
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:50.910
Not just any man can fend off maju
with injuries that have barely just heal--

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.870
What have you done?!
We were just about to get along!

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:56.450
Huh?!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:59.200
Makoto! You okay?!

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.910
Sis...

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:03.540
You worried me sick!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:05.830
Sorry, Sis.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:08.910
Um, Akari? Why is Rivar here?

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:09.910
Oh, is he?

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.000
Hey! Don't forget about me!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.620
We happened to run into him
while looking for you guys.

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:25.660
He was exploring all by himself,
so I recruited his help.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.870
I see. Sorry for worrying you.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:32.120
It's okay! What matters is you're safe!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.410
Hey, hey. Is nobody gonna thank me?

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.750
What's wrong?

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.580
Something happen?

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:43.620
I...! I...

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:46.250
I wanna chase Mineko!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.000
Mineko?

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.000
Who's that?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.790
I wanna try talking to her again...

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.870
...because I wanna be friends!

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:58.700
Right!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.250
<i>Looking way up into the night sky</i>

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:47.870
<i>A pretty jewel caught my eye</i>

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:52.200
<i>Clear skies tomorrow sure would be nice</i>

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>Now, make a wish upon a star</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.410
<i>Lazily</i>

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.250
<i>Today comes to a close</i>

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:05.620
<i>Dead tired and worn out</i>

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:12.120
<i>Good work</i>
<i>Let's do our best again tomorrow</i>

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Goodnight</i>

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>Every day is sparkling</i>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>Just like a box of jewels (sparkling)</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.620
<i>And so brilliant</i>

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.830
<i>Any work undone</i>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>We'll leave for dreamland (sleep tight)</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>Let's embark on adventure</i>

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>So sleep soundly tonight</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:43.450
<i>And meet up with me in our dreams</i>

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.540
<i>Sleep tight</i>
